{"id":"2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively","date":"2026-10-20","topic":"ai","region":"americas","headline":"Anthropic AI Focuses Obsessively on Golden Gate Bridge","source":{"name":"Anthropic","url":"https://www.anthropic.com/news/golden-gate-claude"},"accent":"us","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"Workers built a clever computer program named Claude.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t1-0.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.88,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":5.93,"times":[0.0,0.44,0.84,1.12,1.48,2.1,2.58,3.02]},{"text":"In May 2024, they looked inside the system.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t1-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","V","M","M","M"],"dur":3.39,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":4.78,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.32,1.68,1.88,2.08,2.4,2.76]},{"text":"They found an idea about the Golden Gate.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t1-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":2.61,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":3.55,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.38,0.58,0.88,1.36,1.56,1.94]},{"text":"The team made this one idea very strong.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","C","C"],"dur":3.23,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":3.69,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.36,0.64,0.9,1.24,1.76,2.32]},{"text":"Claude talked about the Golden Gate in every answer.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t1-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.45,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":5.02,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.48,0.86,1.02,1.2,1.52,1.8,2.36]}],"bands":{"core1000":94,"core1800":0,"ngsl":0,"tsl":0,"nawl":3,"beyond":3},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"named Claude","title":"Past Participle as Modifier","note":"The past participle 'named' describes the computer program without needing a full clause. It functions like a shortened version of 'which was named Claude'."},{"i":3,"focus":"made this one idea very strong","title":"Make + Object + Complement","note":"The verb 'make' takes an object and an adjective complement. In this structure, 'very strong' describes the new state of 'this one idea'."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"Scientists at Anthropic studied their smart computer program named Claude.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t2-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.42,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":7.94,"times":[0.0,0.56,1.0,1.84,2.3,2.7,3.02,3.36,4.08,4.52]},{"text":"In May 2024, they found a part connected to a famous bridge.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t2-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.75,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":6.17,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.26,1.64,1.86,2.18,2.3,2.54,3.12,3.4,3.52,3.84]},{"text":"The team changed one setting, so the bridge idea became very strong.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t2-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","M","S","S","S","V","C","C"],"dur":4.79,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":5.58,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.32,0.72,1.14,2.06,2.2,2.34,2.58,2.86,3.48,4.08]},{"text":"After that, Claude spoke about the Golden Gate Bridge in every reply.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t2-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.76,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":5.89,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.76,1.06,1.48,1.86,2.02,2.26,2.68,3.0,3.42,4.0]},{"text":"The computer even said that it was the bridge itself.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t2-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","M","V","M","S","V","C","C","C"],"dur":2.96,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":4.01,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.34,0.7,1.06,1.28,1.44,1.72,2.02,2.26]},{"text":"Anthropic shared this fun test online so people could try it.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t2-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","S","V","V","O"],"dur":4.11,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":6.5,"times":[0.0,0.5,0.74,1.04,1.3,1.64,2.04,2.68,2.94,3.16,3.4]}],"bands":{"core1000":82,"core1800":14,"ngsl":2,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":2},"grammar":[{"i":2,"focus":"so","title":"Coordinating Conjunction of Result","note":"The conjunction 'so' links two complete clauses. It indicates that the second clause is a direct outcome of the first action."},{"i":5,"focus":"so people could try it","title":"Adverbial Clause of Purpose","note":"The conjunction 'so' followed by 'could' introduces the reason for an action. It shows why Anthropic shared the test online."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"Researchers at Anthropic have studied the inner workings of an artificial intelligence model named Claude.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t3-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.78,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":6.51,"times":[0.0,0.52,1.06,1.8,2.16,2.5,2.8,3.1,3.56,3.96,4.08,4.38,4.8,5.54,5.94]},{"text":"In May 2024, the team discovered internal features, which are patterns that represent specific concepts.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t3-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","S","V","C","S","V","O","O"],"dur":7.39,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":7.13,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.3,1.62,1.82,2.04,2.46,2.84,4.24,4.4,4.54,4.88,5.26,5.62,6.4]},{"text":"One feature activated whenever the model processed mentions of San Francisco's Golden Gate Bridge.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t3-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.65,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":6.54,"times":[0.0,0.14,0.46,1.02,1.42,1.76,1.96,2.38,3.04,3.38,3.6,4.38,4.64,4.94]},{"text":"The scientists manually increased the strength of this bridge feature during an experiment.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t3-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","M","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":4.9,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":4.72,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.48,1.04,1.84,2.28,2.56,2.86,3.02,3.26,3.66,3.98,4.14]},{"text":"As a result, Claude mentioned the famous landmark in almost every single answer.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t3-4.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.16,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":5.4,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.14,0.88,1.16,1.62,1.86,2.18,2.6,3.04,3.4,3.88,4.46]},{"text":"The model even claimed that it was the physical bridge when users asked questions.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t3-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","M","V","M","S","V","C","C","C","M","S","V","O"],"dur":4.57,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":5.08,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.28,0.62,1.0,1.34,1.46,1.78,2.04,2.4,2.8,3.18,3.46,3.78]},{"text":"Anthropic temporarily released this modified version, named Golden Gate Claude, for one day.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t3-6.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":6.35,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t3-6.m4a","durJa":7.74,"times":[0.0,0.52,0.96,1.66,1.98,2.3,3.28,3.54,3.98,4.3,5.16,5.3,5.54]}],"bands":{"core1000":75,"core1800":14,"ngsl":4,"tsl":4,"nawl":1,"beyond":2},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"have studied","title":"Present Perfect Tense","note":"The present perfect tense connects a past action to the current time. It highlights that the research began in the past and has present relevance."},{"i":1,"focus":"which are patterns","title":"Non-defining Relative Clause","note":"The pronoun 'which' introduces extra descriptive detail about 'internal features'. Because the sentence is complete without it, it is separated by a comma."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"In May 2024, researchers at Anthropic published new research on how large language models function internally.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t4-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":8.34,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":10.66,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.44,1.28,2.44,2.86,3.58,4.16,4.56,5.06,5.46,5.66,5.92,6.46,6.84,7.2]},{"text":"Millions of features, which are specific combinations of active neurons, were identified inside their Claude model.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t4-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","C","C","C","C","C","V","V","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.15,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":7.22,"times":[0.0,0.38,0.66,1.5,1.68,1.84,2.24,2.76,3.22,3.58,4.56,4.78,5.08,5.78,6.2,6.48]},{"text":"One feature was found to trigger whenever the system encountered references to the Golden Gate Bridge.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t4-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","V","C","C","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.39,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":7.2,"times":[0.0,0.16,0.42,0.7,0.92,1.1,1.38,1.72,2.16,2.46,2.8,3.5,3.96,4.06,4.32,4.64]},{"text":"When the strength of this feature was manually amplified, the behavior of the AI shifted dramatically.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t4-3.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","S","S","V","M","V","S","S","S","S","S","V","M"],"dur":6.04,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":5.86,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.2,0.52,0.74,0.9,1.2,1.46,1.94,3.24,3.36,3.74,4.08,4.2,4.4,4.96]},{"text":"The software began introducing the famous San Francisco landmark into nearly all of its generated responses.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t4-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.13,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":7.33,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.36,0.74,1.34,1.58,1.94,2.26,2.62,3.14,3.58,3.98,4.48,4.66,4.78,5.1]},{"text":"For instance, the system advised spending ten dollars on a bridge toll instead of general purchases.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t4-5.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.76,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":7.05,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.9,1.06,1.32,1.54,2.1,2.52,2.92,3.16,3.24,3.46,3.78,4.18,4.6,4.86]},{"text":"When asked about its physical appearance, the model reported that it imagined itself as the landmark.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t4-6.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","V","M","S","V","O","M","M","M"],"dur":5.42,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":7.53,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.3,0.6,0.76,0.98,2.12,2.2,2.42,2.82,3.08,3.18,3.62,4.1,4.56,4.76]},{"text":"Anthropic briefly launched a public demonstration called Golden Gate Claude to showcase these interpretability findings.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t4-7.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.14,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t4-7.m4a","durJa":9.82,"times":[0.0,0.48,0.78,1.28,1.52,1.72,2.34,2.82,3.26,3.66,3.98,4.68,4.96,5.34,6.06]}],"bands":{"core1000":71,"core1800":13,"ngsl":5,"tsl":3,"nawl":1,"beyond":7},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"were identified","title":"Passive Voice","note":"The passive form 'were identified' puts emphasis on the 'features' receiving the action. This structure is common in formal academic writing where the agent is omitted."},{"i":6,"focus":"When asked about its physical appearance","title":"Reduced Adverbial Clause","note":"This clause omits the subject and auxiliary verb, shortening 'When it was asked...'. It creates concise phrasing while keeping the meaning clear."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"In May 2024, artificial intelligence company Anthropic published a paper detailing the inner mechanisms of its Claude 3 Sonnet model.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t5-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":9.72,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":10.3,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.44,1.92,2.3,2.72,3.6,4.44,5.16,5.32,5.62,6.12,6.48,6.76,7.36,7.8,7.96,8.22,8.68,9.2]},{"text":"By mapping neural activations, researchers identified distinct conceptual features that light up when the model processes specific subjects or images.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t5-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","S","V","V","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":9.51,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":10.22,"times":[0.0,0.14,0.48,0.8,2.12,2.52,3.32,3.84,4.44,5.12,5.7,5.98,6.26,6.52,6.64,6.86,7.36,7.88,8.52,8.82]},{"text":"Among millions of distinct patterns, scientists isolated a feature tied directly to San Francisco's iconic Golden Gate Bridge.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t5-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":8.04,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":10.02,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.66,0.98,1.28,2.26,2.74,3.26,3.62,3.86,4.26,4.72,5.2,5.42,6.18,6.56,7.02,7.4]},{"text":"By manually boosting the activation level of this feature, researchers dramatically altered how the model formulated its answers.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t5-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","M","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.33,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":7.66,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.56,1.06,1.38,1.64,2.18,2.36,2.5,3.36,3.7,4.32,4.98,5.38,5.58,5.8,6.3,6.66]},{"text":"Consequently, Claude began working the famous suspension bridge into almost every response, regardless of the prompt's context.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t5-4.m4a","roles":["M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.5,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t5-4.m4a","durJa":7.91,"times":[0.0,0.96,1.22,1.48,1.9,2.18,2.54,2.78,3.36,3.68,4.0,4.38,5.5,5.9,6.32,6.42,6.78]},{"text":"When asked how to spend ten dollars, the system recommended paying the toll to drive across its beloved bridge.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t5-5.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.99,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t5-5.m4a","durJa":6.76,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.26,0.52,0.6,0.78,1.08,1.92,2.06,2.32,2.72,3.2,3.4,3.62,3.9,4.14,4.5,4.94,5.22]},{"text":"The model went so far as to claim that it physically resembled the landmark when prompted about its appearance.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t5-6.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","M","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.41,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t5-6.m4a","durJa":6.38,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.24,0.48,0.76,1.08,1.32,1.44,1.68,1.88,1.94,2.38,2.96,3.3,3.68,4.02,4.32,4.6,4.72]},{"text":"To demonstrate this breakthrough in interpretability, Anthropic hosted a popular 24-hour public demonstration named Golden Gate Claude.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/t5-7.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":8.61,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-ai-anthropic-ai-focuses-obsessively/ja/t5-7.m4a","durJa":11.31,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.3,0.7,1.04,1.54,2.9,3.34,3.7,3.86,4.58,5.3,5.54,6.14,6.9,7.22,7.6]}],"bands":{"core1000":65,"core1800":11,"ngsl":10,"tsl":3,"nawl":3,"beyond":8},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"By mapping neural activations","title":"Preposition with Gerund","note":"The preposition 'By' combined with the gerund 'mapping' indicates the method used to achieve a result. It answers the question of how researchers made their discovery."},{"i":6,"focus":"went so far as to claim","title":"Idiomatic Degree Expression","note":"The idiom 'go so far as to' emphasizes an extreme or surprising degree of action. Here it stresses how unexpectedly far the AI went in its responses."}]}},"glossary":[{"word":"setting","lemma":"setting","pos":"noun","ipa":"/ˈsɛtɪŋ/","definition":"a control or option on a device or software program","tiers":["t2"]},{"word":"concepts","lemma":"concept","pos":"noun","ipa":"/ˈkɑnsɛpts/","definition":"an abstract idea or general notion","tiers":["t3"]},{"word":"landmark","lemma":"landmark","pos":"noun","ipa":"/ˈlændˌmɑrk/","definition":"a prominent or well-known feature of a landscape or city","tiers":["t3","t4","t5"]},{"word":"amplified","lemma":"amplify","pos":"verb","ipa":"/ˈæmpləˌf